Luxury Safari & Wellness Resort in Fort Portal, Uganda | Tabebuia Spa & Safari Resort
top of page
Luxury Safari & Wellness Resort Fort Portal, Uganda
A secluded eco-luxury retreat overlooking Lake Nyabikere, designed for rest, renewal, and reconnection with nature.
Tabebuia
Spa & Safari Resort
Tabebuia Spa & Safari Resort is a luxury eco-friendly retreat nestled on the shores of Lake Nyabikere near Fort Portal, Uganda. Designed as a tranquil haven, the resort blends modern elegance with locally inspired architecture, offering breathtaking views, serene landscapes, and an intimate connection to nature.
​
Whether you are seeking deep relaxation, curated wellness experiences, or immersive nature encounters, Tabebuia offers a refined balance of comfort, privacy, and authenticity.
Stay
Luxury lakeside accommodation designed for privacy and comfort. Choose from Lakeside Lullaby Suites, Whispering Lake Villas, and Lakeside Breeze Residences, all featuring expansive balconies with uninterrupted lake and nature views.
​
View Accommodation
Spa & Wellness
​
A holistic luxury spa experience inspired by serene Balinese retreats. Guests enjoy restorative treatments designed to rejuvenate the body and calm the mind, complemented by peaceful surroundings and intentional design.
​
Explore Wellness
Nature & Safari
​
Experience the natural beauty of Fort Portal and its surroundings through guided nature walks, birdwatching, and curated wildlife safaris. Guests can also arrange guided visits to Kibale National Park for chimpanzee tracking and immersive rainforest experiences.
​
Discover Experiences
Dining
​
A refined farm-to-table dining experience featuring local and international cuisine. Meals can be enjoyed in the restaurant or served privately by the infinity pool, in the tea house, or by the fire pit overlooking Lake Nyabikere.
​
Explore Dining
Signature Features
​
Infinity Pool, Tea House & Fire Pit
Panoramic lake views designed for quiet moments and sunset gatherings.
Luxury Spa
Holistic treatments focused on relaxation, restoration, and balance.
Weekly Gatherings
Curated wellness and dining experiences available to book in advance.
​
Find out more
Into Stillness - Retreat
​
Into Stillness is Tabebuia's monthly luxury wellness retreat series, curated in collaboration with Activate Body Therapy. Held on the tranquil shores of Lake Nyabikere, each retreat invites guests to slow down, reset, and reconnect through guided movement, meditation, spa therapies, and plant-forward nourishment.
​
Rooted in the foundations of reclaiming the body, restoring the mind, and nourishing the whole self, Into Stillness offers an intimate, immersive experience designed for deep renewal.
​
View Retreats
Weddings & Events
​
Tabebuia Spa & Safari Resort hosts intimate weddings, private celebrations, and curated group experiences.
From romantic getaways to wellness gatherings and milestone moments, the resort provides a breathtaking natural backdrop and personalized service for unforgettable occasions.
​
Plan an Event
Day Guests & Pre-Booking
​
Day visits are welcome at Tabebuia Spa & Safari Resort. All dining, spa treatments, and experiences must be pre-booked to ensure a personalized and seamless guest experience.
​
Contact Reservations
